OL,3,GNEWSAGamer granny is oldest female
OL,4,AFortnite streamer in world record book
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 78-year-old Scottish grandmother has
OL,7,Fbeen named the world's oldest female
OL,8,FFortnite streamer by Guinness World
OL,9,FRecords.
OL,11,FCath Bowie, who is originally from
OL,12,FMoray but now lives in Inverurie, began
OL,13,Fplaying the online shooter in 2017 and
OL,14,Fnow has an audience of more than 24,000
OL,15,Ffollowers.
OL,17,FShe was introduced to the game by her
OL,18,Fgrandson, who was 17 at the time, and
OL,19,Fsays no-one is "ever too old to start
OL,20,Fgaming".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
